# Checkout · Single Input · Any Language (LOCKED)

## Rule

- **One control per data field** on storefront checkout / cart / profile address (name, city, district, notes, coupon, gift card).
- Customer may type **Arabic, English, or mixed** in the **same** field — **no** duplicate `name_en` + `name_ar` inputs on public forms.
- Chrome labels follow locale (`isAr`); **merchant-entered** catalog text stays as saved.
- Bilingual merchant fields (`*_en` / `*_ar`) are **dashboard-only** or display-by-locale — not twin inputs on checkout.

## Light / dark

- Storefront checkout panels: **readable contrast** — `text-neutral-900` on light surfaces; icons/buttons never same color as background (no dark-on-dark).